cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "agent-harness: guardrails, budgets, approvals, tracing, and scenario evals for tool-using LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  A small Python runtime for multi-step, tool-using LLM agents. Runs are bounded by step, token,
  cost, and time budgets; untrusted text passes through typed guardrails; write tools require
  approval; every run produces a span tree; and YAML scenarios gate behaviour in CI.
type: software
